(Non-blocking reap with no children at all is a genuine error (ECHILD),
 distinct from the 0 "nothing finished yet" return: it goes negative and
 sets the error flag, catchable with On error. The exact errno is not
 asserted - only that the return is negative and the flag fires.)

Set 'reap result' to reap any child process without waiting.
On error print "no children error caught".
If 'reap result' is less than 0 then,
    Print "reap result is negative as expected".